# Logging-only instrumentation (D1), equivalent unified diff against controlled_run/train_grpo.py @ 981475795538eee391c7e86aa022ee609b539770.
# Not applied to the training checkout (which stays clean at 9814757); camera_ready/launch_train.py applies the same two changes at runtime:
#   1. GRPOConfig.logging_steps = 1 (Transformers default 10 was used for seed 42): Trainer logs grad_norm (pre-clip total norm returned by
#      accelerator.clip_grad_norm_), learning_rate and TRL metrics every optimizer step. Extra work per step: one scalar loss gather and metric averaging.
#   2. PolicySnapshotCallback.on_log appends each log record to <run>/camera_ready_step_log.jsonl on rank 0.
# Neither touches the model, loss, sampling, batching, RNG consumption or the optimizer. Clip coefficient is derived post hoc as min(1, 1.0/(grad_norm+1e-6)).
